  "details": "Currently, there are several ways to support creators, most of them tied to the Creator Economy.\n\nI think it could be interesting to also have the option to add a “Gift VRC+” button in worlds. This would allow players to more easily gift VRC+ to the world creator by directly opening the “Gift VRC+” dialog for that creator.\n\nThat feature would not necessarily be linked to the CC, but could be an option, and it wouldn't require the player to buy VRC credits.",
